{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GG-Party \u2013 Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GG-Party \u2013 Demo</strong> gives you an exclusive first look at the ultimate open-world party game for up to 8 players! Jump into the innovative GG-Party Mode and experience the future of party games \u2013 without any boring dice rolls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Demo Content:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll play the <strong>GG-Party Mode</strong> with the following preset parameters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win Condition:</strong> Be the first to reach $1,000,000</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round Length:</strong> Fixed intervals of 5 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starting Money:</strong> $10,000</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Count:</strong> Up to 8 players (local or online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed Settings:</strong> Not customizable in the demo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a compact but fully explorable open world, complete quirky quests, invest in properties, upgrade your houses with mining GPUs, and sabotage your rivals. Every 5 minutes, you'll dive into an action-packed minigame \u2014 your path to riches is anything but boring!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Minigames Included in the Demo:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo gives you a taste of the early minigame highlights. It features a rotating selection from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paintball</strong> \u2013 Pure FPS action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run</strong> \u2013 Parkour racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomber Dudes</strong> \u2013 Classic bomb-blasting chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RC-Monstertrucks</strong> \u2013 Mini off-road racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helicopter</strong> \u2013 Explosive aerial combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanks</strong> \u2013 Heavy-duty arena battles with multiple modes: Last Man Standing, Most Kills in Time, or First to 10 Kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camper-Wash</strong> \u2013 Funnier than it sounds! Who scrubs their camper the fastest?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paintshop</strong> \u2013 Strip rust and repaint your car faster than everyone else</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quads</strong> \u2013 Pure adrenaline on four wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jet Ski</strong> \u2013 Wet and wild racing fun</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udeab Not Included in the Demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament Mode</strong> (a marathon of minigames)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigame Mode</strong> (freely select individual minigames)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Game Rules</strong> (no adjustments to win condition, round duration, or starting money)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, pick your favorite color, plug in your controller \u2013 and race to become the island\u2019s first millionaire!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925230?t=1757884095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925230?t=1757884095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925230/5e8764d4c6892d96b895659b927566f2438174d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757884095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925230/5e8764d4c6892d96b895659b927566f2438174d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757884095","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id"